      "en": "The address map (printed pp.30-50) has text columns shifted line by line in the PDF, so only items whose names could be matched by frame examples, the decimal point tables (printed pp.25-28) or the text are included. Alarm settings (40257-), palettes, ramp/soak etc. are left out."
    },
    {
      "ko": "FIX 하지 않으면 통신으로 쓴 값은 전원을 끄면 사라진다(인쇄 p.16). 쪽 번호는 인쇄 쪽(PDF = 인쇄 + 3).",
      "en": "Without FIX, values written over communication are lost at power-off (printed p.16). Page numbers are printed pages (PDF = printed + 3)."
